			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240140601,
					"content": "Have you helped me place the fry into the water?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140602,
					"content": "I have.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140603,
					"content": "Thanks so much. Once I fix my divesuit, I'll come back and continue my work.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140604,
					"content": "I hope those fish will grow up safely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140605,
					"content": "Don't worry, I've prepared many species of fry for all sorts of waters and different environments.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140606,
					"content": "The batch that you placed earlier was chosen specifically for this region.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140607,
					"content": "I'll place a few more batches, and then the adventurers we hired will come over and clear out the Mekafish in the area.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140608,
					"content": "I believe that this batch will grow up healthy and restore the ecological environment in this area.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140609,
					"content": "Once enough water bodies have recovered, I'll write a long-form report. I'll tell the public what the Fontaine Research Institute has done to our natural environment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140610,
					"content": "Just you wait, Damestier. I won't let you stop me again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2401407,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2401401",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2401401,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Linorea"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240140701,
					"content": "Hmph. These Mekafish are clockwork machines created by the Fontaine Research Institute. They're the ones ruining the waters in the Court of Fontaine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140702,
					"content": "A water body usually has a balanced ecosystem where various fish and other creatures live together within a stable order. This order allows them to grow and thrive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140703,
					"content": "Even though this order is sometimes disrupted when, say, people come to fish, when invasive species are introduced...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140704,
					"content": "Sometimes, the weather also shifts, causing some fish to leave these waters...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140726,
					"content": "There is a subtle balance being maintained within this water body, on the whole.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140705,
					"content": "But everything turned into a complete mess ever since those idiots at the Institute created the Mekafish!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140706,
					"content": "They promote them as tools that can keep the waters clean by removing trash and other assorted items in the water. Nothing else, they say!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140707,
					"content": "And at first, that is what they did, and we believed the nonsense they fed us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140708,
					"content": "But after a while, we received reports that fish populations were constantly decreasing in water bodies where Mekafish were deployed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140709,
					"content": "That's when we realized that the Mekafish labeled other fish as \"trash\" when doing their cleanup work!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140710,
						240140711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140710,
					"content": "So that's how they define \"clean water\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140712
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140712,
					"content": "Faced with intense resistance from us, those researchers deactivated the Mekafish and prepared for their retrieval.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140713,
					"content": "But as they were preparing to do so, there was a huge explosion at the Institute...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140714,
					"content": "After that, some of those originally deactivated Mekafish reactivated themselves, and began attacking fish even more fiercely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140715,
					"content": "Several of my colleagues and I agreed that this could not go on. If the Mekafish are left to run amok, they will bring calamity upon our aquatic ecosystem!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140716,
					"content": "So, with the help of several environmentalists, we planned to place suitable fish fry in various water bodies and cultivate new batches of fish through artificial means.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140717,
					"content": "On the other hand, we hired adventurers to constantly destroy and retrieve Mekafish, thus forming a two-pronged approach to protecting the ecology of our waters.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140718,
						240140719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140718,
					"content": "An impressive ambition.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140720
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140720,
					"content": "Thank you for your praise — I know this doesn't sound like something a journalist should be doing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140721,
					"content": "However, I believe that our duty to go to the frontline and do some practical work comes before writing essays and articles.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140727,
					"content": "Only by doing frontline work can we obtain the truest and most accurate information, with which the best report can be written.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140722,
					"content": "Wow, this reporter's really impressive...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140723,
					"content": "What can I do to help?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140724,
					"content": "Hmm? Well, thanks for your kind offer. My divesuit is currently non-functional, so I can't go underwater to distribute fish fry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140725,
					"content": "If you don't mind, could you go down and do it for me? Shallow or deep zones, doesn't matter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140719,
					"content": "An admirable plan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140720
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140711,
					"content": "Everything that's not water is considered trash...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140712
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2401408,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2401401",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2401401,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2401401",
							"1"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Linorea"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240140801,
					"content": "These Mekafish... What a pain!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140802,
						240140803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140802,
					"content": "What's happened?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140804
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240140804,
					"content": "I did, but it fell apart quite quickly afterward.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140805,
					"content": "The Mekafish in this area have gone hog-wild, for... whatever reason.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140806,
					"content": "No sooner did I try to place the fish fry in their vicinity that they swarmed over, gobbling the fry up non-stop.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140807,
					"content": "Some of them even lunged at me to get the few fry hanging off my divesuit...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140808,
					"content": "I mean, I know they won't attack me... But that was still terrifying.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140809,
					"content": "I struggled, flailing in the water...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140810,
					"content": "I don't know how, but that tore another large hole in my divesuit somewhere... Fortunately, I was close enough to the shore that getting back up ultimately proved possible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140811,
					"content": "As things stand, however, I won't be able to distribute the fry for the time being.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140812,
					"content": "Traveler, could you help me do it once again? Shallow or deep zones, doesn't matter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linorea"
				},
				{
					"id": 240140803,
					"content": "Have you fixed your divesuit?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240140804
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}